    "sections": {
        "description": "The Online Organic Store Theme offers a structured design for displaying products, categories, images, and supporting business information. Its responsive layout adapts to desktop, tablet, and mobile screens, keeping page content accessible across different devices. Customizable sections provide options for arranging featured products, category details, introductory content, and other elements according to the site&#039;s structure. Organic food stores can use product-focused sections to organize items and provide relevant descriptions. Organic product businesses may use image areas and category layouts to present different product groups in a consistent format. The theme supports WooCommerce, which can add functions such as product listings, shopping carts, checkout, and order management. Health food stores can organize informational pages alongside product content, while organic grocery stores may structure categories according to their inventory. Natural food stores can use navigation menus to separate product groups and general business information. Additional pages such as About, Contact, and Services can be added as needed. Colors, typography, images, and other available design settings can also be adjusted to maintain a consistent visual structure throughout the website."
    },
